                    Astir Frequently Asked Questions

The latest version of this file is in the repository, at
<https://github.com/queueingqt/Astir/blob/master/FAQ>.

This is Astir's FAQ.  It used to be Xastir's, and most of what was in it
described problems that cannot happen here -- Motif dialogs, X colormaps,
private visuals, bitmap fonts.  Those answers were correct for a program this
one no longer is, and keeping them would have sent people looking in the wrong
place.  If you are running Xastir, its FAQ is the one you want:
<https://github.com/Xastir/Xastir>.


